105695	105782	105573	105574	Charles Hatfield	415	“ Yes:--and it was not until last night that I was aware of the frightful arrangement which my mother had thus made -- the dreadful compact to which she had assented . It seems that this nobleman had heard of me -- and the description given of my appearance pleased him ; so that when he yesterday discovered the existence of some paper which at once annihilated all my mother ’s previously conceived hopes of gaining the law - suit , he promised his hateful conditions . ”
