475641	475815	475625	475625	Green	823	“ For twelve long years , sir , I have been your slave -- your vile and abject slave . I was a criminal , it is true , when I first came to you -- for I had committed that forgery which you detected , and which placed me in your power . But I had still the feelings of a man -- whereas you soon imbued me with such ideas and reduced me to such a miserable state of servitude , that I have wept bitter , bitter tears at the thought of my own deep degradation . I could have lied for you -- I could have committed perjury for you -- I could have performed all the meannesses and condescended to do all the vile and low trickery which form part and parcel of your business:--but when I found myself used as a mere tool and instrument and treated like a spaniel , without ever having a single kind word uttered to cheer me beneath a yoke of crushing despotism---- ”
